        <mxCell id="power_energy_legend" parent="power_zone" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#334155;spacing=8;" value="Pload = load consumption | Ploss = device/conversion loss | Pout,design = regulator sizing capability&lt;br&gt;EXTERNAL load capacity ≠ INTERNAL gateway dissipation. Buck outputs: design capability; conversion losses unverified.&lt;br&gt;Conduction figures use resistance references at 25 °C; BSP75N loss uses the maximum resistance for that condition.&lt;br&gt;Static protection loss is distinct from surge energy. Detailed conditions and currents: Power Budget (§8)." vertex="1">
